``` dirsift Splunk searches (SPL) ```
``` dirsift run golden-run | author cyb3rp03t | TLP:AMBER ```
``` target hxxp://panel-gate[.]xyz/files/ | scan started 2026-10-01T09:00:00.000Z ```
``` Found in an open directory, not a verdict: hunt with it, decide yourself. ```
``` assumes Splunk CIM data models Network_Traffic, Network_Resolution, Web and Endpoint ```
``` live values, not defanged: import it, do not open it in a browser or paste it in a chat. ```

``` 1. connections to addresses found in the directory (Network_Traffic) ```
| tstats summariesonly=false count min(_time) as first_seen max(_time) as last_seen from datamodel=Network_Traffic where (All_Traffic.dest_ip="198.51.100.23" OR All_Traffic.dest_ip="203.0.113.9" OR All_Traffic.dest_ip="2001:db8::7") by All_Traffic.src_ip All_Traffic.dest_ip All_Traffic.dest_port

``` 2. DNS lookups of domains found in the directory (Network_Resolution) ```
| tstats summariesonly=false count min(_time) as first_seen max(_time) as last_seen from datamodel=Network_Resolution where (DNS.query="c2.evil-update.top" OR DNS.query="cdn.panel-gate.xyz" OR DNS.query="panel-gate.xyz" OR DNS.query="*.c2.evil-update.top" OR DNS.query="*.cdn.panel-gate.xyz" OR DNS.query="*.panel-gate.xyz") by DNS.src DNS.query

``` 3. web requests to hosts and URLs found in the directory (Web) ```
| tstats summariesonly=false count min(_time) as first_seen max(_time) as last_seen from datamodel=Web where (Web.url_domain="c2.evil-update.top" OR Web.url_domain="cdn.panel-gate.xyz" OR Web.url_domain="panel-gate.xyz") OR (Web.dest="c2.evil-update.top" OR Web.dest="cdn.panel-gate.xyz" OR Web.dest="panel-gate.xyz") OR (Web.url="*c2.evil-update.top/gate.php?id=1&k=**" OR Web.url="*panel-gate.xyz/files/*" OR Web.url="*raw.githubusercontent.com/someone/tools/main/x.ps1*") by Web.src Web.dest Web.url

``` 4. processes started from files read whole in the directory (Endpoint) ```
| tstats summariesonly=false count min(_time) as first_seen max(_time) as last_seen from datamodel=Endpoint.Processes where (Processes.process_hash="*9f2c1b7d3e4a5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f90a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8*" OR Processes.process_hash="*0a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f9*") by Processes.dest Processes.process_name Processes.process_hash

``` 5. the same files written to disk (Endpoint Filesystem) ```
| tstats summariesonly=false count min(_time) as first_seen max(_time) as last_seen from datamodel=Endpoint.Filesystem where (Filesystem.file_hash="*9f2c1b7d3e4a5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f90a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8*" OR Filesystem.file_hash="*0a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f9*") by Filesystem.dest Filesystem.file_name Filesystem.file_hash
